=== F3. after a pod, a data column cannot become a tag (no operator does it)
pod output keys(): (('subject_id', 'session_start_datetime', 'recording_index', 'probe_index'), ('probe_id', 'depth_mm'))
Join(pod output, probe) keys(): (('probe_id', 'subject_id', 'session_start_datetime', 'recording_index', 'probe_index'), ('probe_model', 'probe_id', 'depth_mm'))
-> probe_id stays data; joining on it needs the column as a tag, which only
   re-rooting (as_table() + a new source) can do today.
